==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Kabuki Ashura (Enemy)|Kabuki Ashura]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

